WEBVTT

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.160
No!

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.480
Fate doesn't matter.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.900
Focus on us, right now...

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:26.000
Zessica?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.980
M-Man!

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:31.970
I was late to lunch, and they were all out of yakisoba sandwiches...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:34.670
Zessica...

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:37.060
Um...

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.470
What you said before Aquarion went out of control...

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:43.430
I love you.

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:47.940
I... I can't...

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:52.070
Right now, Mikono—

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:54.460
It's all right.

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:58.560
I knew it would turn out like this, anyway.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:00.800
Bye!

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.950
Zessica, wait!

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:11.400
Mikono...

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:16.180
I'm sorry for disturbing you.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:23.120
Wait! Mikono! It's not like that!

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.770
Mikono!

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:38.700
First the Special Training of the Grave and then the mock battle...

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:41.160
It appears that they're ripening.

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:45.860
It may be time to dig it up.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.920
Yep, I got rejected.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:35.400
So, today at lunch, I think you got the wrong...

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:46.120
Never mind. Forget I said anything.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.840
What's the matter with you? Love is forbidden, remember?

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:56.380
People could have died in that battle!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.500
Get your mind off love!

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.700
Guess so.

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:06.060
On the other hand, when we're all fighting side by side,

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:09.300
it's the perfect time for passionate love to grow.

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:12.060
It's a human instinct.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:16.060
You want to pass on your genetic information before putting your life on the line.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.560
Genetic information?

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:21.440
That's a mere physical Union!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.200
I'm talking about pure love here!

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:37.400
But if I really were going to die...

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:40.210
I guess I'd want to pass on my genes.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:53.230
Emergency meeting?

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:56.280
Everyone is here, I see.

00:04:56.280 --> 00:05:00.150
I would like to entrust you with a mission of utmost secrecy.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:04.820
But did you have to notify us like this?

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:07.660
So what's this top secret mission?

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:11.450
You must go to a place and dig up an item.

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:12.950
What's the item?

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.210
Top secret.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:15.960
Where's the place?

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.210
Top secret.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.210
And we get to dig?

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.460
Top secret.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.340
You'll be leaving tomorrow.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:27.080
All you need to know and bring with you

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:29.350
is detailed in this strategic handbook.

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:31.850
Remember, this is completely secret.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.300
Do not let anyone else know.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.350
Excuse me, High Commander?

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:42.500
I'm sure you're all concerned after seeing this obviously handmade book,

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.480
but you must keep this in mind:

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.580
the bananas are not snacks!

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:54.040
It's beautiful!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.780
Keep it down. This isn't just a field trip.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:58.040
What?

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:01.290
So these are our supplies?

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.880
They're pretty weird-looking bananas.

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:07.300
The hell?

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.300
Seeds?

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:12.720
These must be an old type of banana.

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:16.230
Bananas aside, where are we going?

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:20.460
He wouldn't say, and the Vectors are preprogrammed.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:21.980
We're just along for the ride.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:25.040
Do you know, Professor?

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:28.900
All I know is that I have to lead.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:32.740
Not even Professor Donar was told about this operation.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.990
This really <i>is</i> top secret!

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:39.220
What does the High Commander want us to dig up?

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.540
What if it's...

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.640
the mythical Legendary Aquarion?

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:47.760
The Legendary Aquarion?

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:55.260
But even if the legend is real...

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.730
What's going to happen if we dig it up?

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:03.110
So they've finally started...

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:06.720
searching for the Wings of the Sun.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:14.580
The Legendary Aquarion is supposed to be here?

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:18.200
It would be a good place to hide it, I suppose.

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:23.800
This is a lake! How does the High Commander expect us to dig in a lake?

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:26.250
Wait there for a while.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.300
You're all free until further orders.

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:32.260
You heard him.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.340
We have free time?

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:35.890
That's what he said.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:38.560
So that's what these are for!

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:40.140
Check it out!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.900
Things to bring... swimsuits?

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:47.440
If you have forgotten your swimsuit, there are some in the transport.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.870
Forget the war for now and let your souls be cleansed.

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:57.580
W-What are you staring at?

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:02.290
Hidden beneath Professor Suomi's normal tough, strict shell...

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.220
is a beautiful lady!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:09.420
Zessica's normal clothes may seem risque,

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.680
but she looks so fresh in that swimsuit!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:16.040
But the star of today's show...

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:24.350
Even in a modest swimsuit, those big bangs are making universes left and right!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:26.920
Mix...

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:33.220
Of course, Mikono's swimsuit is cute,

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:34.960
but Yunoha...

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:36.720
is unbelievably adorable!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.950
Hey, are you ignoring me on purpose?

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.290
Mikono...

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:53.640
The wind blowing over the lake plays a melody.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:57.720
Doesn't it feel wonderful, my friend?

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.940
Should we really be doing this?

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:04.120
There's nothing else we can do until the High Commander gives us instructions.

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:07.100
Let's enjoy this. Consider it part of our training.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:08.380
Training?

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:12.500
Are we still not good enough?

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:15.360
Here I go!

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:22.620
This isn't really about the swimsuit, but...

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:26.120
Mix is really pretty.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.440
Yeah...

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:30.500
Mikono sure is pretty.

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.840
Damn it! My genes are going nuts!

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:39.800
What am I doing, watching this opportunity go by?

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.350
Ready, aim, fire!

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.500
Andy!

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.530
Ow!

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:58.320
Sorry. Are you okay?

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:02.100
I'm fine. It's just a bruise.

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:05.800
It's nothing compared to the pounding pain in my heart!

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.500
Did you get hit in the chest, too?

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.500
That's not what I meant...

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:11.800
Well, I'm done.

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:12.580
Huh?

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:15.880
But I advise you to rest for a bit.

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.970
Mix!

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:25.500
Stay with me just a little longer.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:30.480
I want to talk to you... alone.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:42.780
They've been in there for a while.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.440
What are Andy and Mix doing, anyway?

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:48.140
Let's bring them some of these.

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:52.790
I think we should leave them alone.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.590
By the way, where's Mikono?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:56.680
She...

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:58.680
Zessica's missing, too.

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:09.400
I'm so stupid.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:13.020
Mikono!

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:17.230
I just wanted to be away from everyone.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:22.490
It looks like we're on the same wavelength today.

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:27.460
Put this on, or you'll catch a cold.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.800
So, Mix...

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:34.640
I know there's that "love is forbidden" thing...

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:39.010
But if I don't say this now, I'll hate myself forever.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:42.510
Hate yourself? Whatever for?

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:52.940
Andy?

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:56.960
Mix! After the war with the Abductors is over...

00:11:56.960 --> 00:12:01.790
Damn it. I'll be triggering my own death flag if I say this, huh?

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:05.690
Screw it! I'm not going to die!

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:09.190
Please, after this war is all over...

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:11.210
Um...

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:13.640
<i>Say it! Just say it, Andy!</i>

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:20.710
<i>Say, "I know I'm all about digging holes, but let me fill the hole in your heart!"</i>

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:23.220
Andy...

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.470
Mix!

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:28.290
<i>Let me fill the hole in your heart!</i>

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:31.960
<i>Let me... fill the hole...</i>

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:33.800
Mix!

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:34.980
Yes?!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:38.110
Let me fill your hole!

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:43.100
My... hole?

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:46.320
Your hole!

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:53.540
No, wait! Not that hole! The one in your heart! I meant the...

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:59.360
Did you guys just hear a really loud sound?

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:02.540
I hate you!

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:07.470
In your heart...

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:13.860
I think I envied you all this time, Zessica.

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:14.890
What?

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:19.400
You can be open and honest with your feelings all the time.

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:25.520
You were able to tell Amata how you felt.

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:30.100
A lot happened before I could, though.

00:13:32.150 --> 00:13:35.120
I envy you, too, Mikono.

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:38.870
You're sweet, and you always do your best.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:42.880
I'm sure all the boys want girls like you.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.720
You're wrong!

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:47.480
Zessica, you're way more popular with the boys!

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:48.660
Nah.

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:54.980
They'll pick girls like you in the end.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:59.640
Girls who they can fight for and protect.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.940
Zessica?

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:07.140
The sky!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:08.990
Is that a...

00:14:15.070 --> 00:14:17.250
It's a Dimensional Gate!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:20.020
Amata, let's boot up the Vectors!

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:20.750
Yeah!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.600
What are the Abductors doing out here?

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:25.260
Wait, Andy!

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:28.510
I screwed up.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:31.560
She totally hates me now.

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:34.500
I'm such a moron.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:39.620
I want to crawl in a hole...

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:51.200
Dimensional Gate opening at the Lakeside area, zone ANH!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.340
The regular Elements are out?

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:56.320
What's going on here?

00:14:56.320 --> 00:14:58.710
Relax, Donar.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:02.710
Chairman Crea! High Commander! What's happening?

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.700
What is that Abductor?

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:22.960
Let's get out of here, Mikono!

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:25.560
Andy!

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:31.180
Andy, what are you doing?

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:32.260
It's dangerous in this weather!

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:34.530
Get out of that hole!

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:38.900
Why? Leave me alone.

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:39.710
What?

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:51.010
Winter Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:15:57.550 --> 00:16:00.480
Aquarion Gepard!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:06.770
We'll handle this weird Abductor.

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:09.780
Shrade, take care of everyone left above ground!

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:11.780
Of course, my friend!

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:25.940
It's so cold!

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:29.130
I'm from the south, so this cold is extra intense for me!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.660
Take shelter in this hole Andy dug!

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:34.640
You'll be protected from the cold underground!

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:38.390
Did the Abductor cause this blizzard?

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:46.300
We'll be okay. Amata will save us.

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:58.240
Damn it! Without our Element suits...

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.990
The heat isn't working?

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:02.580
Cold... so cold...

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:17.060
How deep did Andy dig?

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:18.890
Andy!

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:20.460
Andy...

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.180
It's over...

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:25.890
It's all over for me...

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:28.900
Andy's aura level is almost at minimum!

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:31.650
Then it's time.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:34.900
Time to dig it up!

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:37.910
Do it, Andy W. Hol!

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:50.400
What is this?

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:09.520
This sound...

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:12.520
is resonating across dimensions.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.580
What the...

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:20.030
It's finally begun, Fudo.

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:23.260
The seed that fell into the earth is sprouting.

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:26.440
In time, it bears fruit year after year.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:31.860
Thus does it bestow life upon the next generation!

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:34.840
It's cold...

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.950
Water? No, wait, is that milk?

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:43.720
It's warm...

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:47.560
This is a hot spring? It smells funny.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:50.230
What are you doing here?

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:52.740
I'm back!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:55.360
Sorry!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.020
Zessica?

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:59.280
Mikono?

00:18:59.280 --> 00:18:59.990
Amata!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:11.460
Mixed Bath Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.380
I can feel it rising up!

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:20.260
From the depths of the earth!

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:22.390
The energy of life itself!

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:27.970
Aquarion Evol!

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:39.060
In ancient alchemy, men and women boiling in one pot

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:44.280
represented them working together and covering for the weaknesses of the other.

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:47.040
The Elements are coming together in the bath,

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:50.040
fighting as one and covering each others' weaknesses.

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:55.040
Is that what you wanted from this special training, High Commander Fudo?

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:03.390
So that's why we're bathing together. But why the bananas?

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:07.890
Bananas are fruits that represent ripening!

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:14.650
In the Garden of Atlandia, the Serpent that tempted Eve hid itself in a banana tree.

00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:19.530
The banana is the fruit of Paradise, and the fruit of the Sun.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:24.440
As it ripens, the banana rises up and faces the Sun!

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:28.840
This feels wonderful!

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:31.920
I feel warmth all through my body!

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:35.320
Let's warm up!

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:44.300
Aquarion...

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:46.800
has shed its peel.

00:20:59.670 --> 00:21:03.780
Cluster Infinity Punch!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:14.380
Break him!

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:20.160
They did it!

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:26.720
Fill the hole... in your heart...

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:33.230
I've found a fragment of the Wings of the Sun.

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:37.240
But the better parts of them are elsewhere.

00:21:39.490 --> 00:21:43.500
You can have as many fruits of the Sun as you wish.

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:47.140
But as for the Wings of the Sun...

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.280
Morning, Amata!

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:00.000
Morning...

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:03.980
Um, Zessica?

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.560
Zessica, what are you wearing?

00:22:07.560 --> 00:22:09.000
What happened?

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:13.430
I just had a change of heart.

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:16.060
Oh, I forgot to tell you...

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:23.570
Amata rejected me.

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:25.140
But that's okay.

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:28.140
If love ripens, Aquarion goes nuts, you know.

00:22:28.850 --> 00:22:33.450
I'll keep loving Amata, even if he never loves me back.

00:24:11.300 --> 00:24:13.540
Who was I back then?

00:24:15.150 --> 00:24:18.520
A strong-willed and confident fighter!

00:24:18.520 --> 00:24:20.480
A strong-willed...

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:23.860
I don't know! I don't understand!
